description=A pure-Lua independent training belt. Qualifying on-foot movement trains Fitness, Strength, Sprinting, Sneaking, Nimble and Lightfooted. Each physical skill gains 5 base XP per game minute of qualifying movement at the default multiplier of 1. Training XP multiplier: 0.1 to 20. Final XP also uses native XP settings, character traits and applicable protein-drink bonuses. Item weight is 10; normal worn encumbrance is about 3 under the game's default 0.3 coefficient. A separate slot allows existing belts and chest rigs. Craft from 2 ripped sheets, 1 stone and 2 planks in the Weight Training Belt category. Single-player only.
descriptionzh=纯Lua独立负重带，穿戴后有效徒步移动可训练体格、力量、冲刺、潜行、灵活和轻巧。默认倍率为1，每累计移动1游戏分钟，每项体能技能获得5点基础经验；沙盒倍率范围0.1至20。最终经验还会叠加原版经验设置、人物特质，以及适用的蛋白饮料加成。本体重量10，按原版穿戴系数0.3计入约3负重。使用独立槽位，可与原有腰带、胸挂共存。在“负重带”分类消耗碎布2、石块1、木板2即可制作，无额外工具或技能要求。仅限单人游戏。
